Subject: Cantor Public Procedure Machine Schema Plan

@ [plan_uuid] 75038c9e-49ee-491d-96f4-69194e64661e
@ [canonical] C:\Project\Cantor\specifications\Cantor_Public_Procedure_Machine_Schema.sop

& [FormationPlan] is complete
  + preserve source and inherited authorities
  + audit current CLI, MCP, core forms, and gap assessment
  + refine vocabulary, constraints, data design, seven folds, canonical, justification, requirements, and review
  + do not select a schema library during formation without an implementation dependency assessment

& [ImplementationDAG] is strict
  + CPMS-I01 extract public pure forms and dispatcher with exact current CLI byte and exit oracle
  + CPMS-I02 choose and pin schema generator, implement deterministic normalization, duplicate-key rejection, bounds, document and bundle digests
  + CPMS-I03 build residual registry, positive and adversarial conformance corpus, and independent schema-serde comparison
  + CPMS-I04 produce provider-neutral structural tool definitions for prepare run verify
  + CPMS-I05 run compatibility, security, release, and residual audit

& [ImplementationPrerequisites] block I01 claim
  + inventory every transitive public type used by prepare run verify and response
  + measure extraction blast radius and exact base-output golden digests
  + assess candidate schema libraries against Rust 1.96, Draft 2020-12 support, serde attribute fidelity, dependency risk, and offline availability
  + set numeric bounds for bundle and generator resources
  + decide whether shared forms live in cantor_core or a new pure cantor_procedure_tool crate

& [GlobalGates] remain required
  + focused conformance and golden tests
  + full debug and overflow-checked release workspace tests
  + formatting and warnings-denied lint
  + offline locked tests, release build, docs, local advisory audit, current evidence VerifyOnly zero, frozen manifests exact, and diff audit

& [Rollback] is per slice
  + I01 must leave current CLI oracle available
  + later schema and definition modules can be removed without changing CPPE semantic core
